## Why AetherPulse?

AetherPulse is built around a simple idea:

> Monitoring should be fast, observable, extensible, and easy to deploy.

The architecture is intentionally modular so additional capabilities such as Telegram alerts, Discord notifications, Prometheus metrics, web dashboards, Docker deployment, and distributed monitoring can be added without rewriting the core engine.

